1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,383
5 things you must do in
Iran, when it's safe again.

2
00:00:03,713 --> 00:00:07,242
One. Stand in Naqsh-e
Jahan Square, in Isfahan.

3
00:00:07,262 --> 00:00:09,754
A UNESCO site, built around 1600.

4
00:00:10,134 --> 00:00:11,772
Two. Walk through Persepolis,

5
00:00:11,792 --> 00:00:14,535
the ceremonial capital
of the Achaemenid Empire.

6
00:00:14,915 --> 00:00:18,417
Three. See the Pink Mosque,
in Shiraz, at sunrise.

7
00:00:18,797 --> 00:00:23,459
Four. Look up inside the wind catcher
at Dowlat Abad Garden, in Yazd.

8
00:00:23,479 --> 00:00:24,972
Almost 34 meters tall.

9
00:00:25,352 --> 00:00:29,485
Five. Eat faloodeh in Shiraz. Frozen
noodles, rose water, and lime.

10
00:00:29,505 --> 00:00:32,108
One of the world's oldest frozen desserts.

